msgid ""
"Create beautiful,<br/><span class=\"platform-line\">accessible<br/><span "
"class=\"platform web\">web</span></span><br/>apps."
msgstr ""

#: index.md:7
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"One resolved token model, reshaped into stylesheets, framework bindings, "
"native code, and design-tool payloads."
msgstr ""
"Satu model token yang diselesaikan, dibentuk semula menjadi helaian gaya, "
"pengikat rangka kerja, kod asli, dan muatan alat reka bentuk."

#: index.md:10
#, no-c-format
msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "Memulakan"

#: index.md:13
#, no-c-format
msgid "CSS reference"
msgstr "Rujukan CSS"

#: index.md:16
#, no-c-format
msgid "API reference"
msgstr "Rujukan API"

#: index.md:22
#, no-c-format
msgid "One source of truth"
msgstr "Satu sumber kebenaran"

#: index.md:23
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Every packages uses the official Instructure design tokens, components, and "
"interactions from <a href=\"https://instructure.design\" "
"target=\"_blank\">InstUI</a>."
msgstr ""

#: index.md:27
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use the smallest package"
msgstr "Gunakan pakej terkecil"

#: index.md:28
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Install just <code>@pantoken/css</code> for a stylesheet, <code>@pantoken/"
"pendo</code> for guides, or a bundler preset for Tailwind, Panda, or MUI."
msgstr ""
"Pasang sahaja @pantoken/css untuk helaian gaya, @pantoken/react untuk hooks "
"dan ikon, atau pratetap bundler untuk Tailwind, Panda, atau MUI."

#: index.md:32
#, no-c-format
msgid "Generate for any platform"
msgstr "Jana untuk mana-mana platform"

#: index.md:33
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Install the pantoken cli to generate presets or add components for any "
"platform&colon; web, native, and anything in between."
msgstr ""

#: index.md:37
#, no-c-format
msgid "No React needed"
msgstr ""

#: index.md:38
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The InstUI library is tightly coupled with React. If you want to use it, you "
"have to use React. Now you can build anywhere."
msgstr ""

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "InstUI, everywhere"
#~ msgstr "InstUI, di mana-mana"

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Every package reads the same resolved token IR. Change a token upstream "
#~ "and it flows to CSS, SCSS, native code, and Figma the same way."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Setiap pakej membaca IR token yang sama yang telah diselesaikan. Tukar "
#~ "token di hulu dan ia mengalir ke CSS, SCSS, kod asli, dan Figma dengan "
#~ "cara yang sama."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Run `pantoken generate` to emit Swift, Kotlin, Compose, Flutter, Rust, "
#~ "WordPress, and more. The same tokens, in each ecosystem's idiom."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Jalankan `pantoken generate` untuk menghasilkan Swift, Kotlin, Compose, "
#~ "Flutter, Rust, WordPress, dan lain-lain. Token yang sama, dalam idiom "
#~ "setiap ekosistem."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "No upstream coupling"
#~ msgstr "Tiada pengikatan hulu"

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "The tokens ship vendored as static JSON, so `npm i` never reaches for a "
#~ "GitHub-only source. Publishable, semver'd, offline-friendly."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Token dihantar sebagai JSON statik yang dibundel, jadi `npm i` tidak "
#~ "pernah mengambil dari sumber eksklusif GitHub. Boleh diterbitkan, "
#~ "menggunakan semver, mesra luar talian."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "The package map"
#~ msgstr "Peta pakej"
